      "question": "Find the value of x in the equation given 8x+1 \u2013 8x-1 = 63.",
      "options": [
        "Option A",
        "Option B",
        "Option C",
        "Option D"
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "Option A",
      "explanation": "So the equation becomes: 8\u22c58x \u2212 8x/\u200b8 = 63\nLet y=8x\nSubstitute: 8\u22c5y \u2212 y/\u200b8 = 63\n(64y - y)/8 = 63\n63y /8 = 63\ny = 504/63 = 8\n8x = 81\nx = 1"
    },
